==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|дитя́}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|Audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ru|orv|дѣтя}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*dětę}}. The ''и'' of the first syllable in the singular is from {{l|ru|дити́на}}, nowadays written {{l|ru|дети́на}} by analogy with the accented {{l|ru|де́ти}}, with regular distant assimilation ''ѣ''…''и́'' > ''и''…''и́''. An alternative formulation by Šakhmatov (''ѣ'' > ''и'' before a soft consonant) explains these forms more directly.

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|ru|дитё}} {{qualifier|non-standard, partially declinable}}

