# {{lb|ru|dated|or|poetic}} [[child]], [[baby]], [[kid]] (also used ironically or in similes)

=====Usage notes=====
* The [[oblique case]]s of singular '''''дитя''''', except for the [[accusative case]], are never used in speech and seldom in modern prose writing, as many native speakers do not intuitively understand their exact inflectional roles in relation to '''''дитя''''', and may consider them strange or even un-Russian. Instead, the corresponding cases of {{m|ru|ребёнок}} are used.
* The plural forms are standard and in common use, and serve as the normal plural forms of {{m|ru|ребёнок}}.

